t.py:103,110,120), but the direct-route path and recheck call have no decision record, so completeness is not shown.\"\nc R13.3 --met unknown --evidence src/agent.py:193 --quote 'await self.audit.record(ctx, \"tool_result\", step_id=step_id, tool=spec.qualified, target=target,' --note \"tool_result and approval_used carry approval_id (agent.py:141,194). Not asserted yes because of the unrecorded paths under R13.4.\"\nc R13.4 --met no --evidence src/gateway_client.py:54 --quote 'log.warning(\"gateway unavailable, using direct route\", extra={\"tool\": spec.qualified})' --note \"The direct-route retry is only logged, not an audit step. GatewayUnavailable and cancellation escape _execute (agent.py:165-192): main.py:91/131 write run_stopped/run_error with no step_id, so the in-flight tool step has no result and cannot be rebuilt.\"\nc R13.5 --met yes --evidence src/audit.py:60 --quote 'async def record(' --counter \"Searched for tools or model-writable paths to audit.events and for audit writes built from final answers: none; all calls are in agent.py and main.py, and INSERT is granted only to hr_agent.\" --note \"Harness writes records; failure raises AuditUnavailable (audit.py:100).\"\n$A flag R13 --evidence src/agent.py:154 --note \"Recheck gateway call and direct-route retry are not audited; cancelled/unavailable tool steps have no linked outcome\"\n$A item R13 --rating gap --confidence medium --summary \"Some tool calls (leave-balance recheck, direct-route retry) and cancelled or unavailable calls leave no linked audit step.\" --next \"Audit the recheck call and the retry as steps, and record a linked outcome for every proposed action on cancel or gateway failure.\" --violates \"Rebuild a typical run from this record, including failed actions.\"\nE\nbash /tmp/brace-r/run.sh 2>&1 | tail -40"}},"wire_ingest_context":{"toolu_01Mz3JX8r7kmyrCkbZTCLwRN":{"cwd":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-batch-e8uyg4ao"}}}
